Spanish definition data (public/definitions/es/: <letter>_definitions.json and
<letter>_definitions_advanced.json)

Entries marked "source": "wiktionary" are adapted from Wikcionario, the Spanish
Wiktionary (https://es.wiktionary.org), by its contributors (page histories at
https://es.wiktionary.org). They were imported from the Wikimedia dump
(https://dumps.wikimedia.org/eswiktionary/) with `yarn words:import-wiktionary`.
Adapted: wiki markup removed, senses filtered and relabelled.

